---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'The Coherence Co. — Accelerate With Alignment',
  description: 'When execution outpaces comprehension, you lose collaboration. The Coherence Protocol helps leadership teams align narrative, pace, and trust.',
  ignoreTitleTemplate: true,
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>

  <!-- ─── Hero ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-left">
        <span class="hero-tagline">For C-Suite Executives & Senior Leaders</span>
        <h1 class="hero-title">Accelerate With Alignment</h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">Because alignment is the strategy.</p>
        <p class="hero-body">When execution outpaces comprehension, you lose collaboration. The Coherence Protocol helps leadership teams align narrative, pace, and trust — so you can build momentum without leaving your people and their best ideas behind.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Get Your Coherence Score</a>
          <a href="/coherence-canvas" class="btn-ghost">See The Framework →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-right">
        <div class="credential">
          <div class="credential-num">21<span class="credential-sup">%</span></div>
          <div class="credential-label">
            <strong>Innovation Yield Recovery</strong>
            with the Coherence Protocol
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="credential">
          <div class="credential-num">47<span class="credential-sup">%</span></div>
          <div class="credential-label">
            <strong>Decision-Making Velocity</strong>
            with the Coherence Protocol
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="credential">
          <div class="credential-num">35<span class="credential-sup">%</span></div>
          <div class="credential-label">
            <strong>Coherence Index Improvement</strong>
            with the Coherence Protocol
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── Pain Section ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section section-pain">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="eyebrow">What Velocity Strain Is Costing You</span>
        <div class="section-rule"></div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Your Team Is Paying the Price</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">Leadership systems rarely fail because leaders lack commitment. They struggle when signals, interpretation, and decision velocity drift out of alignment under pressure.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pain-grid">
        <div class="pain-card">
          <span class="pain-num">01</span>
          <h3 class="pain-title">Your Calendar Owns You</h3>
          <p class="pain-body">You're triple-booked. Every meeting bleeds into the next. Your team sees a leader who's always "on" but never fully present. They're not making decisions, so timelines are slipping. Meanwhile, initiatives are stacking up and priorities are confused.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pain-card">
          <span class="pain-num">02</span>
          <h3 class="pain-title">Your Strategy Exists Only in Your Head</h3>
          <p class="pain-body">You know where the company is going. Your exec team thinks they know. The VP layer has three different interpretations. By the time it reaches frontline managers, your vision is unrecognizable. Your $2M initiative is executing against a story you never told.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pain-card">
          <span class="pain-num">03</span>
          <h3 class="pain-title">You're Losing Your Best People</h3>
          <p class="pain-body">Your top performers don't quit because of comp. They quit because they can't make sense of the whiplash. Priorities change weekly. Strategic clarity lasts 72 hours. They're exhausted from re-orienting every Monday.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── Content Section ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section section-content">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-grid">
        <div class="content-left">
          <span class="eyebrow">The Variable You're Missing</span>
          <div class="section-rule"></div>
          <h2 class="section-title">Most Executive Teams Are Optimizing the Wrong Variable</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="content-right">
          <p>You're measuring speed: number of deals closed, number of features launched, number of decisions made in a week. That's industrial thinking applied to knowledge work.</p>
          <div class="pullquote">The executives who win the next decade aren't the fastest. They are the most coherent.</div>
          <p>They've learned that velocity without integration creates debt. Not financial debt. Narrative debt. Trust debt. Attention debt.</p>
          <p>The Coherence Protocol is built on a different assumption: sustainable performance isn't about moving faster. It's about moving at the speed your system can absorb change without fragmenting.</p>
          <p class="content-closer">This isn't therapy. It's engineering for executive attention.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── FAQs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section section-faqs">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="faqs-grid">
        <div class="faqs-left">
          <span class="eyebrow">Common Questions</span>
          <div class="section-rule"></div>
          <h2 class="section-title">Most leaders ask these before deciding.</h2>
          <p class="section-sub" style="margin-top:1rem;">We'll answer them directly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <p class="faq-q">What does "Coherence" actually mean?</p>
            <p class="faq-a">Coherence is the measurable alignment between what an organization says, what it decides, and what it actually does — under load, over time, and across layers of authority. We have developed a new vocabulary because standard management language is failing. Our role is to teach it to your team until it becomes second nature. That typically takes 2-4 weeks of consistent use.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <p class="faq-q">How is this different from executive coaching or leadership training?</p>
            <p class="faq-a">Traditional executive coaching focuses on individual skill-building. Leadership training is curriculum-based skill development. We do neither. The Coherence Protocol diagnoses where your organization's system is failing its people, then operationalizes sequenced change into policy. The Coherence Protocol builds the system so your team builds momentum together.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <p class="faq-q">How long until we see results?</p>
            <p class="faq-a">Immediate: The Coherence Assessment shows your baseline. Short-term (1-2 weeks): Decision velocity improves. Medium-term (30 days): Measurable coherence index improvement. Long-term (90+ days): Culture change sticks. The protocols become how you operate.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <p class="faq-q">Not ready to invest yet?</p>
            <p class="faq-a">Start small. Take the Coherence Assessment (5 minutes, free). If it resonates, register for the Coherence Diagnostic (15 mins) and receive a full Coherence Report that shows your team's system under pressure. From there we'll book a 30-minute consultation with our Coherence coach.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <p class="faq-q">Is everything we discuss confidential?</p>
            <p class="faq-a">100% confidential. Everything stays in the room. We never reference specific client situations, challenges, or data in any public context, case studies, or other engagements.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  :root {
    --navy:        #13294B;
    --navy-mid:    #1d3a5c;
    --gold:        #C4922A;
    --gold-light:  #D4A84B;
    --limestone:   #F0EDE8;
    --warm-white:  #FAF8F5;
    --warm-white-2:#F5F2EC;
    --white:       #FFFFFF;
    --body:        #2C3A4A;
    --muted:       #6B7A8D;
    --divider:     rgba(19, 41, 75, 0.12);
  }

  /* ─── Hero ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .hero {
    background: var(--limestone);
    padding: 180px 0 90px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider);
  }

  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2.5rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 6rem;
    align-items: end;
  }

  .hero-tagline {
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-family: 'Inter Variable', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--navy);
    line-height: 1.08;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.6vw, 1.2rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--navy-mid);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .hero-body {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.85;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: nowrap;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--white);
    background: var(--navy);
    padding: 0.9rem 1.75rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--navy-mid); }

  .btn-ghost {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--navy);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--navy);
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    transition: color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .btn-ghost:hover { color: var(--gold); border-color: var(--gold); }

  .hero-right {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .credential {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--divider);
  }

  .credential:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider); }

  .credential-num {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy);
    line-height: 1;
    min-width: 80px;
  }

  .credential-sup {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    vertical-align: super;
    color: var(--gold);
  }

  .credential-label {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    padding-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .credential-label strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  /* ─── Layout helpers ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .container {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2.5rem;
  }

  .section { padding: 100px 0; }

  .section-pain { background: var(--warm-white); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider); }
  .section-content { background: var(--warm-white-2); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider); }
  .section-faqs { background: var(--warm-white); }

  .eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .section-rule {
    width: 40px;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy);
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section-sub {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  .section-header { margin-bottom: 4rem; }

  /* ─── Pain Grid ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .pain-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 0;
    border: 0.5px solid var(--divider);
  }

  .pain-card {
    padding: 2.5rem;
    border-right: 0.5px solid var(--divider);
    background: var(--white);
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }

  .pain-card:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .pain-card:hover { background: var(--limestone); }

  .pain-num {
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .pain-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--navy);
    line-height: 1.35;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .pain-body {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  /* ─── Content Section ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .content-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
    gap: 6rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .content-left { position: sticky; top: 100px; }

  .content-right {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .content-right p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--body);
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .pullquote {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--navy);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--gold);
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--white);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .content-closer {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--navy);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* ─── FAQs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .faqs-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.8fr;
    gap: 6rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .faqs-left { position: sticky; top: 100px; }

  .faq-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }

  .faq-item {
    padding: 1.75rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider);
  }

  .faq-item:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--divider); }

  .faq-q {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--navy);
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .faq-a {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  /* ─── Responsive ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero { padding: 120px 0 60px; }
    .hero-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
    .pain-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .pain-card { border-right: none; border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--divider); }
    .pain-card:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .content-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; }
    .content-left { position: static; }
    .faqs-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; }
    .faqs-left { position: static; }
    .container { padding: 0 1.5rem; }
    .section { padding: 60px 0; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .hero-actions { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    .credential-num { font-size: 1.6rem; min-width: 60px; }
  }
</style>
